\newlabel{tab:calib}{{1}{6}{Predicting a judge's resolution limit. Residual standard deviation is in units of true quality (fraction of an answer's factual content); lower is better. Gold-label predictors require an annotated meta-benchmark; $\dstyle $ requires none}{table.1}{}}
